; ── Cards ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; NavCard is the Library's card: the 3px cyan LEFT border is an affordance, not
; decoration — it marks "this whole box is tappable and goes somewhere"
; (HubFeatureCard semantics). SectionCard is the static equivalent: same geometry,
; 1px all-round border, no accent. Never give a static box the cyan edge.

